2 bedroom apartment, new, with 68 m2 and 12 m2 of balcony.

Parking space.

New Studios, One-Bedroom, and Two-Bedroom Apartments with Garage | Metro Gaia Residence | Vila Nova de Gaia

Introducing Metro Gaia Residence, a new residential project under construction, combining contemporary architecture, functionality, and comfort, designed for both owner-occupancy and investment.

Available in studio, one-bedroom, and two-bedroom layouts, all apartments include a parking space and have been designed to provide bright, practical spaces adapted to the demands of daily life.

Located in Vila Nova de Gaia, it benefits from excellent access, proximity to shops, services, a hospital, and a metro station just steps away, allowing for quick trips to Gaia, Porto, and other surrounding areas.

Main Features:

* Studio, one-bedroom, and two-bedroom apartments;

* Parking space included in all units;

* Balconies and/or terraces (depending on the layout);

* Equipped kitchens;

* Air conditioning;

* Heat pump for water heating;

* Window frames with thermal break and double glazing;

* Elevator.

Construction began in March 2026, with completion scheduled for July 2028.

Payment terms according to the progress of the work, available upon request.

Request information on prices, floor plans, finishing schedule and availability. 

